    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "信号（Signal Browser Definition）：In each month, run a cross-sectional regression of a firm's five-year stock return on 5 year lagged BM (defined above) and a constructed regressor that is the change in BM from 5 years ago to today plus the five-year stock return. The residual from that regression is IntanBM. 组合规则（该页字段）：StockWeight=EW；LSQuantile=未写；PortfolioPeriod=1.0个月；StartMonth=6.0；Sign=-1.0；TestInOP=mv reg。股票池/过滤：abs(prc)>5。 基线为原论文分组的多空组合（FAQ：baseline follows the original paper split；数据页写 monthly long-short following OPs）。未在该行写出的细节不补。"
    },
